<title>USA: Hamburger Hamlet to divest locations.</title>
<headline>Hamburger Hamlet to divest locations.</headline>
<dateline>SHERMAN OAKS, Calif. 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hamburger Hamlet Restaurants Inc said late Friday, after the market closed, that it has put its only remaining Illinois location on the market.</p>
<p>The company also said that it will close its Westwood, California restaurant because it is unable to arrive at a satisfactory lease arrangement that would support the investment it believes that location requires.</p>
<p>Hamburger Hamlet said it is considering the sale of several restaurants where buyer interest is high.</p>
</text>
